      "modify_from": "For each usable demonstration frame, locate the lower free end of the stick, not the upper shaft, robot housing, marker or trail.",
      "modify_to": "Identify the stick as the narrow rigid extension beneath the hand and track the centre of its distal end through the demonstration. At the initial act cycle, project the reported TCP into the current execution view to check which visible feature represents the free tip at z=0.07 m; do not transfer a constant image-space offset to other poses. For each usable demonstration frame, measure that same distal-tip feature, not the lowest pixel of the hand, the shaft centre, robot housing, marker or trail. An occluded distal end is an unavailable tip measurement, not permission to substitute a nearby feature."
